WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.790
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
in my Arrow and Flash videos I asked you to

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:08.590
submit all your questions about the new seasons
so I picked 10 of them to answer and one bonus

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.590
question.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.679
Since yesterday we also got a much longer
extended trailer for The Flash, so I’ll

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.369
mention the new stuff we learned.

00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:18.000
If you’re finding me for the first time
I’m going to be doing Arrow and Flash videos

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.820
every week until the new seasons premiere.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.390
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
leave me suggestions for bonus videos.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.720
So let’s pick apart the new footage from
The Flash.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.460
Most of the stuff we saw we already knew about.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.829
The Costume being from Star Labs, his inner
circle of Caitlin and Cisco.

00:00:32.829 --> 00:00:37.230
Tom Cavanagh looks like he’s going to be
their version of Feliticy, the tech person.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.900
Which I think is funny.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.320
I loved the way Star Labs looks.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.320
It seems like they’re going to have a secret
or special area inside the facility that they’ll

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:46.730
use as their version of the Arrow Cave.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.310
The big news is Weather Wizard.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.000
He’s going to be the first villain and the
first Rogue on the show.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.640
What is seems like they’re doing is combining
aspects of the New 52 versions of the characters

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.030
and the classic Flash Rebirth story.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.700
In the classic Flash stories, the rogues aren’t
meta-humans.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.020
They just have technology that gives them
their powers.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:06.250
In the new 52 comics, they all get exposed
to a special Star Labs device that gives them

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.610
real powers.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:12.640
It seems like some or all of the villains
on the show will have real powers.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:17.020
Based on the particle accelerator causing
all the weird energy to spill into their dimension.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:19.670
I loved the way Weather Wizards powers looked
on the show.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:21.540
I think the special effects are great.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.520
Zoom as a villain was confirmed.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:26.370
It’s pretty clear he was the one who killed
Barry’s mother.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:30.820
We can unpack that in the comments for people
who don’t know that story from the comics.

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:39.869
The show itself is premiering in October at
the same time as Arrow Season 3.

00:01:39.869 --> 00:01:46.049
It’s going to be on Tuesday Nights at 8PM
and Arrow will still be on Wednesdays at 8.

00:01:46.049 --> 00:01:51.360
Which means it will be way easier for me to
do videos for both of them, yay.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:57.909
Also it was confirmed at the upfronts that
Malcolm Merlyn would be a cast regular.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:00.049
Meaning he’d be in most of the episodes.

00:02:00.049 --> 00:02:03.790
Not necessarily as the main villain, but as
his antagonistic self.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.781
So he’s probably going to cause trouble
for Team Arrow even if he’s not the big

00:02:07.781 --> 00:02:08.781
bad.

00:02:08.781 --> 00:02:09.781
Time to answer some questions though.

00:02:09.781 --> 00:02:11.319
Careful for spoilers from the Arrow Finale
if you haven’t seen it yet.

00:02:11.319 --> 00:02:16.170
Here we go Question 1 - Adri on Facebook asks
Andrew Kriesberg said one of the main cast

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:18.370
members would not be starting Season 3.

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:19.700
Who do you think it is?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.900
It’s probably Paul Blackthorne, Detective
Lance.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:27.170
He was at the CW Upfronts, which means he’s
still part of Season 3, so he’s not dying

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.170
or anything.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:31.060
He just sustained internal injuries during
that Police Station fight.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:35.060
He might go into a coma or just sit out a
few episodes on ‘medical leave’ or something

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.060
like that.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.660
But he’ll be back!

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:42.300
Question 2 - Niels asks Could Edward Fryers
from Season 1 on the Island have been hired

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.760
by Amanda Waller?

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:48.300
Yes it’s possible but they’d have to mess
with a few things.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:52.630
Edward Fryers was going to use weapons to
destabilize the Chinese Hong Kong situation.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:57.270
The lady in the red shoes in that scenario
did not look black.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.540
But Amanda Waller was operating in Hong Kong
around that time.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:04.060
They cast Amanda Waller during season 2, so
it’s possible they could retcon that woman

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.560
in red shoes to be Amanda Waller.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:10.440
They retconned Sara Lance when they cast Caity
Lotz.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:13.099
The other possibility is that it’s someone
from HIVE.

00:03:13.099 --> 00:03:20.620
I know a lot of people thought it might be
Isabel Rochev, but she didn’t seem powerful

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:24.330
enough five years ago to pull off an operation
that big.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:30.700
Question 3 - DigiDestined asks what was happening
in that scene after Oliver left the island?

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:37.640
So the Amazo boat blows up and Oliver wakes
up in Hong Kong with Amanda Waller inducting

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.640
him into service.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:41.849
It looks like he worked with her and then
ended up back on the island at some point.

00:03:41.849 --> 00:03:44.760
In the pilot episode he seemed much more cool
and level headed.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:48.349
But that mega beard makes me think he was
stranded.

00:03:48.349 --> 00:03:52.590
So clearly he went on missions for ARGUS in
the five years he was away, then something

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:55.130
went bad and he ended up stranded back on
the island before coming back to Starling.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.629
The interesting thing is that the show always
goes back to the Island.

00:03:58.629 --> 00:04:02.909
Because it’s purgatory it’s this metaphor
for Oliver’s life as well as his hero’s

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:03.909
journey.

00:04:03.909 --> 00:04:05.090
For all you Joseph Campbell Geeks.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:09.989
It’s the transitory state between Justice
League and his old life.

00:04:09.989 --> 00:04:14.850
So until he either dies or the show reaches
that Justice League moment, he’s always

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.090
going to go back there.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.599
So there will still be island scenes in season
3.

00:04:18.599 --> 00:04:23.240
Question 4 - McLovin asks Will Team Arrow
and Team Flash ever combine forces to fight

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.379
a single villain?

00:04:24.379 --> 00:04:29.159
Yes, they can’t have their schwarma Avengers
crossover moment until they defeat some common

00:04:29.159 --> 00:04:30.159
enemy.

00:04:30.159 --> 00:04:32.830
Oliver isn’t going to drop in to just say
high.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.909
Whenever they go on each other’s shows it
will be because there’s a problem in Central

00:04:35.909 --> 00:04:40.419
City that only Oliver and Felicity can solve
and vice versa on Arrow.

00:04:40.419 --> 00:04:41.419
As for who that villain is?

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:45.259
It will depend on who the other big villains
both shows bring on.

00:04:45.259 --> 00:04:49.479
Zoom is the big bad on The Flash, so there’s
the possibility Team Arrow could help Barry

00:04:49.479 --> 00:04:50.479
with that.

00:04:50.479 --> 00:04:52.860
Or Felicity could help him with his Mother’s
murder.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.250
Her skills are very CSI friendly.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.969
Whenever everyone goes to comic con this summer
they’ll also probably talk about what the

00:04:59.969 --> 00:05:01.330
crossovers will be like..

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.360
Question 5 - Peacekeeperboy asks Who do you
think is going to be the main villain next

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.219
season and how many episodes of the Flash
will there be?

00:05:09.219 --> 00:05:12.770
Just talking about the Flash, Zoom will always
be the main villain.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.500
But there’s always a big villain that works
for the main villain.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.259
So it might secretly be Tom Cavanagh’s character.

00:05:18.259 --> 00:05:20.660
Like a wolf in sheep’s clothing kind of
thing.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.389
Or it could be one of the Rogues like Captain
Cold.

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:25.569
My money is on one of the Rogues.

00:05:25.569 --> 00:05:28.629
If not all of them.

00:05:28.629 --> 00:05:31.990
I think we’ll get to see the Rogues unite
during season 1.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.919
We saw Weather Wizard in the trailer.

00:05:33.919 --> 00:05:34.919
As for episodes.

00:05:34.919 --> 00:05:38.139
They haven’t said officially, but the show
has at least 8 or 9 episodes.

00:05:38.139 --> 00:05:41.840
If they get picked up for the second half
they’ll at least get a full 22.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.789
Arrow on the other hand usually gets 23 episodes.

00:05:44.789 --> 00:05:45.789
Which is a lot.

00:05:45.789 --> 00:05:49.990
Most shows only get 20 or 22.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:56.449
At the upfronts, the CW was saying that The
Flash is the one show they are sure is going

00:05:56.449 --> 00:05:57.449
to be a hit.

00:05:57.449 --> 00:06:03.720
So all of their energy is going into promoting
it as the Flagship of all their new shows.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:09.259
Question 6 - magnettoa Which villains do you
think we’ll see on the Flash?

00:06:09.259 --> 00:06:12.569
I think they’ll stick to core rogues in
season 1 with maybe a curveball or two.

00:06:12.569 --> 00:06:14.770
I think there will be at least one surprise.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.309
Like someone that Arrow shares in common.

00:06:17.309 --> 00:06:18.719
Someone we’ve already heard about on Arrow.

00:06:18.719 --> 00:06:20.009
Like HIVE.

00:06:20.009 --> 00:06:21.710
As for Weather Wizard in the trailer.

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.710
If you’re not familiar.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.409
In the pre-new 52 comics.

00:06:24.409 --> 00:06:26.849
He used a Weather Control Rod to control the
Weather.

00:06:26.849 --> 00:06:29.879
Like he was just a regular guy with technology.

00:06:29.879 --> 00:06:34.000
In the new 52 comics and on the show he’s
a meta-human with real superpowers that enable

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.000
him to control weather.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.119
It looks like he’s mostly going to be generating
tornadoes.

00:06:38.119 --> 00:06:40.250
Based on those last moments in the trailer
it seems like in defeating Weather Wizard’s

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:48.059
tornado, Barry is going to learn that there
are levels of speed he can achieve.

00:06:48.059 --> 00:06:52.159
The speedforce isn’t like stop and go.

00:06:52.159 --> 00:06:55.180
It’s like internet bandwidth.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.110
If you have internet at your house.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:01.139
It moves slower when a bunch of people are
downloading stuff at once.

00:07:01.139 --> 00:07:04.379
But when it’s just once person downloading
it’s way faster.

00:07:04.379 --> 00:07:09.879
So the more Flashes that are in one place
accessing the speed force, the slower Barry

00:07:09.879 --> 00:07:11.129
can run.

00:07:11.129 --> 00:07:15.800
Because we know Zoom is Edward Thawne and
he works with Barry you’ve got two people

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:16.800
drinking from the fountain.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.800
Plus if John Wesley Shipp ends up being Jay
Garrick, you’ve got a third Flash.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:21.520
In the comics, when Barry is the only one
accessing the speed force, he can run so fast

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.319
that he can go forwards and backwards in time.

00:07:24.319 --> 00:07:28.479
So him trying to run back in time and prevent
his mother’s murder might be a thing this

00:07:28.479 --> 00:07:29.479
season.

00:07:29.479 --> 00:07:32.219
I think it will take most of the season for
him to figure out the speed force though.

00:07:32.219 --> 00:07:34.520
So don’t plan on time travel any time soon.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.740
This is mostly going to be superhero CSI.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:41.649
Question 7 - Michelle asks What do you think
Felicity’s backstory is going to be?

00:07:41.649 --> 00:07:46.429
Yes, we’re supposed to get a lot more Felicity
backstory in Season 3.

00:07:46.429 --> 00:07:51.040
I think they might invoke some of the Firestorm
aspects of her character from the comics.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.040
In the comics the Ronnie Raymond version of
Firestorm is part of Firestorm.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.599
So they might make her father part of that
mythos.

00:07:54.599 --> 00:07:57.830
Like make her father the Professor Martin
Stein part of the character.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.509
It’s a little far fetched, but I think it
would be so cool.

00:08:00.509 --> 00:08:02.909
There’s also the possibility that they could
change all that and make her Father part of

00:08:02.909 --> 00:08:03.909
HIVE.

00:08:03.909 --> 00:08:07.739
Usually when people in comic book shows don’t
like to talk about their parents a lot it’s

00:08:07.739 --> 00:08:11.289
because something really awful happened to
them, like they were fused with the Firestorm

00:08:11.289 --> 00:08:12.289
Matrix.

00:08:12.289 --> 00:08:17.709
Or they did something really awful.

00:08:17.709 --> 00:08:23.929
A la villains.

00:08:23.929 --> 00:08:27.939
Question 8 - Neto del Toro asks Do you think
Oliver knows about Connor?

00:08:27.939 --> 00:08:29.520
I don’t think he knows.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:34.370
It think they would be trolling us the fans
too much if Oliver always knew everything

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.419
and just never told Team Arrow.

00:08:37.419 --> 00:08:39.849
Like when he had a vial of the cure this season
and just hadn’t told any of the Team about

00:08:39.849 --> 00:08:40.849
it.

00:08:40.849 --> 00:08:44.060
He had the cure the whole season and he waited
six months to tell them.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:45.190
That made me kind of mad.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.850
So I don’t think he’d turn around and
do the exact same thing.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:52.190
But I do think he’ll try to keep his distance
just so his son can stay safe.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:57.250
Remember that speech he gave Felicity about
not keeping the ones you love too close.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.490
That was in the first couple of episodes.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:02.889
Question 9 - Green Quiver asks, could Thea
become Cheshire?

00:09:02.889 --> 00:09:08.310
Totally, I saw a bunch of you commenting on
how she looks a lot more like Chesire in the

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.640
comics than Artemis.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:14.540
And remember, regardless of who is what in
the comics, they can give any minor super

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:21.510
hero persona to any of the characters.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:25.500
So even though Artemis in the comics is the
daughter of Sportsmaster, Thea on the show

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.500
could still become her.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.940
Regardless, she’s going to be more like
the Canary when we see her again.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.040
She’s going to be a much bigger badass.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.600
I can’t wait to see her and Roy have a big
fight scene.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.790
Or her and Oliver.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:37.560
Question 10 - Jean Loup asks Will HIVE come
back?

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:41.529
Even if HIVE isn’t the main villain or group
of villains in season 3, they teased them

00:09:41.529 --> 00:09:42.529
as a pretty big thing this year.

00:09:42.529 --> 00:09:43.529
So we’ll at least get to learn more about
them.

00:09:43.529 --> 00:09:44.670
They’ll just be like an evil version of
ARGUS.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.660
Don’t be surprised if Merlyn gets mixed
up with them.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.839
Remember, he lost his company and all his
money like Oliver.

00:09:50.839 --> 00:09:53.170
So where did he get that limo at the end?

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:56.050
He’s got to be getting money from somewhere.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:10:00.459
Bonus Question - Iron Guardian asks do you
think The Flash will have Flashbacks like

00:10:00.459 --> 00:10:04.700
Arrow or be more like CSI with mystery solving
side quests?

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:09.300
They cast Barry’s mother, so there will
be some flashbacks.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.300
That murder mystery will probably tie into
the finale.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:13.600
But in terms of daily flashbacks, I think
we’ll see more cut-to’s.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:17.120
Like the murder mystery investigation will
be going on off in the background of each

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.120
episode.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.850
So think of it more like an episode of Bones
with superpowers.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:25.699
He’ll be using his abilities and Star Labs
to connect crime scenes to the particle accelerator

00:10:25.699 --> 00:10:29.879
explosion and metahumans.

00:10:29.879 --> 00:10:31.360
So thank you so much for submitting questions.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.170
These are always a ton of fun to do.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.430
Because both shows are on different days I’ll
be doing separate videos for each.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.410
But in the meantime I’ll probably just use
wednesdays for Arrow and Flash bonus videos.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:41.730
Be sure to subscribe to get everything and
let me know what you guys want to talk about

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:42.730
first.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:46.980
Also, let me know if you want me to keep doing
Q&amp;A videos once a week.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:50.570
I’ll probably just combine Flash and Arrow
questions based on the bonus videos I do.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:55.731
Right now click here for my Arrow Finale video
and click here to learn about my top 5 flash

00:10:55.731 --> 00:10:56.731
villains.

00:10:56.731 --> 00:10:59.769
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:10:59.769 --> 00:11:00.779
High Fives!

